{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_0_level_main_00-04_beg",
  "groupId": "main_0",
  "stageId": "main_00-04",
  "title": "混战",
  "storyCode": "0-4",
  "avgTag": "行动前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_00-04_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "1bd7fabbfdc1a59a3ba5de41837778d91efaf270e584236b7cdb7001e7608d51",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "Ace！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "看来，你们都平安无事。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "这里还没到汇合点......怎么只有你一个人？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "他们就是那些从核心区出逃的人！别放他们走！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "呿，穷追不舍！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "E2小队，应敌——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "杜宾，不要恋战，优先后撤！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "阿米娅，Dr.{@nickname}！快！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "这里也不安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "是的，我们还要继续向下一个汇合点移动。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "你的小队呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "text": "藏到哪去了？把他们找出来！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "text": "又来了吗！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，请下命令吧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ace",
      "text": "就像以前那样。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "......？",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "啊，Ace......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "其实有些，小小的变故。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士......意外失去了记忆。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "......原来如此。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "抱歉，Ace......事情和以前相比，有不小的区别。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "是吗。你没必要向我道歉。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "博士的指挥能力，有没有因为失忆受到影响？",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "......和以前一样。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "博士的决策依旧十分可靠，我保证。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "那就好。我听从博士的指挥。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "失去了的东西是可以找回来的。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "眼下有更棘手的问题等着我们去解决。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
          "text": "他们在这儿！快，快攻击！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "text": "聊天还没结束？我已经开始战斗了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，请下命令吧。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
          "text": "放，把那些畜生放出来，让他们尝尝被撕咬的滋味！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "text": "博士！Ace！敌人近在眼前了！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "——",
          "portraitKey": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "立刻出动！",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "......好的。",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "趁现在，破坏敌人的计划吧。",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "明白。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "E3小队！支援杜宾！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
          "text": "埋伏？！！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "text": "E3小队......一直隐藏着行踪，就是等着和我们配合，夹击敌人吗。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "在通讯受到干扰的情况下，小队应该在汇合点附近行动，这样，即使是我或者侦查干员发生了意外......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "整体的撤退计划，依然能够正常实施。这是我的判断。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "text": "也就是说，Ace你把小队留在汇合点，一个人......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "毕竟最重要的，是去除汇合点周围的威胁。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "优先确认你们的状况是一种冒险。我不能带上整个小队一起。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "小队存在的目的，本来就是为了让战术更有效，而不是固步自封，成为拖累。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "杜宾",
          "text": "哈。接下来，用实战去解决了整合运动再说吧！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "阿米娅，拜托你。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米娅",
          "text": "知道了！我会辅佐博士，通过法术支援你们的！",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "终于......",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "Ace",
          "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，请你，指挥罗德岛。",
          "portraitKey": null
        },
        {
          "type": "sceneBreak"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
